# Known failures of the Open POSIX Test Suite on amd64, for
# releasetools/qemutest.py --suite posix --xfail.  Same format as
# qemutest.xfail.  Baseline taken 2026-10-21 on 2 CPUs: 1287 of 1757 tests pass,
# 30 skip (UNSUPPORTED/UNTESTED).  The verdict after each test is what it
# gave then: nobuild (does not compile: the interface or a definition is
# missing), fail, unresolved (the test could not set itself up), timeout,
# signal, wedge (took the system down).  Remove a test here in the change
# that fixes it; XPASS fails the run.

# interfaces/clock
interfaces/clock/1-1                                     flaky  # timing: passed on 1 CPU, failed once on 2
interfaces/clock/2-1                                     # fail

